# Belt and braces. The root .gitignore already denies everything under
# test/data/ except the four tracked files; this repeats it locally so the rule
# survives someone copying this directory somewhere else, and so `git status`
# inside it behaves the same way.
#
# Downloaded payloads and everything the fetchers write:
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!datasets.yaml
!fetch_test_data.py
!fetch_test_data.R
